XFAIL: system-linux && debug-build

Prints how long starting a process takes, directly and through catter (see
the test output); passes as long as all of them run.
Known failures: #137 (debug builds deadlock in vfork children).

RUN: %e2e probe spawn-many 200 | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe spawn-many 200 | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS spawn-many
